-- * Message status:  Optional(1)                                             *
-- * Frequency:       As required                                             *
-- * Input/Output:    Input/Output                                            *
-- *~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~*
-- * Short Description:                                                       *
-- *                                                                          *
-- * SBAS Message Type 7 - Provides fast correction degradation factors for   *
-- * PRNs as defined in DataSBAS1.                                            *
-- *                                                                          *
-- * Notes:                                                                   *
-- *                                                                          *
